## Model card

* **Name:** Cat Jam Free
* **Short description:** A fast stealth model built for agentic coding and reasoning from an undisclosed developer, available as a free-tier option on OpenCode. Alias / variants include `cat-jam-free` and `stealth/cat-jam:free`.
* **Provider / access:** OpenCode / OpenCode Go (`opencode/cat-jam-free` or `opencode-go/cat-jam-free`) via OpenAI Chat Completions API endpoint (`[https://opencode.ai/inference/v1](https://opencode.ai/inference/v1)`).
* **Release / knowledge:** 2026-10-13; knowledge cutoff unknown.
* **IDs:** `opencode/cat-jam-free`, `opencode-go/cat-jam-free`, `stealth/cat-jam:free`
* **Context window:** 262,144 tokens total (verified via Pi agent model spec and OpenCode registry; 131,072 max output tokens).
* **Modalities:** Text input only; text output (supports reasoning traces / extended thinking; tool calling supported; JSON mode supported). Non-multimodal (no image/audio/video input).
* **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** $0.00 / 1M input, $0.00 / 1M output, $0.00 cached input (Free-tier). Free-tier API calls are routed via OpenCode inference infrastructure and may be subject to platform logging/privacy terms.
* **Architecture:** Proprietary / undisclosed stealth model (speculated by community to be an unreleased compact/distilled model variant, e.g., ~30B–40B parameters, given ~200 tok/s inference speed).

